    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Cap Squad: Zombie Source is a <strong><u>hardcore</u></strong> survival roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a commander, recruit diverse members, build a unique elite squad, skillfully use traps and mechanisms to fend off relentless waves of zombies. Survive for 20 minutes to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squad Building and Formation Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from scratch and recruit up to 10 elite soldiers to assemble your exclusive squad. Choose from 4 commanders, 16 types of soldiers, 6 formations, and 40 enhancements. Select your upgrade strategy, arrange soldier positions, and through clever tactical deployment, craft a unique combat style to face the endless tide of zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/677d0928b81aae172b1e27423715d7e7.avif?t=1744331296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Formation Micromanagement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamically rotate and expand your squad's formation to maximize experience collection, optimize attack coverage, and fully utilize defensive capabilities against the relentless swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/d1cb96e586b64e9d7ec082464182cdbc.avif?t=1744331296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traps and Mechanisms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is littered with traps that affect both friend and foe. The game features 4 maps, each with distinct terrain and mechanisms. You need to skillfully utilize traps and tread carefully to avoid falling victim to them yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/6acb0d25f55475ae1c76a9ed697abb4f.avif?t=1744331296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zombie Wave Onslaught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zombie wave brings thousands sweeping in. Fend off uniquely threatening zombies, defeat powerful bosses, and adapt on the fly. Carve a path to survival through this endless tide of terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/4279b2b216582e5ce62322f8fb441353.avif?t=1744331296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Cap Squad: Zombie Source is a <strong><u>hardcore</u></strong> survival roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a commander, recruit diverse members, build a unique elite squad, skillfully use traps and mechanisms to fend off relentless waves of zombies. Survive for 20 minutes to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squad Building and Formation Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from scratch and recruit up to 10 elite soldiers to assemble your exclusive squad. Choose from 4 commanders, 16 types of soldiers, 6 formations, and 40 enhancements. Select your upgrade strategy, arrange soldier positions, and through clever tactical deployment, craft a unique combat style to face the endless tide of zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/677d0928b81aae172b1e27423715d7e7.avif?t=1744331296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Formation Micromanagement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamically rotate and expand your squad's formation to maximize experience collection, optimize attack coverage, and fully utilize defensive capabilities against the relentless swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/d1cb96e586b64e9d7ec082464182cdbc.avif?t=1744331296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traps and Mechanisms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is littered with traps that affect both friend and foe. The game features 4 maps, each with distinct terrain and mechanisms. You need to skillfully utilize traps and tread carefully to avoid falling victim to them yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/6acb0d25f55475ae1c76a9ed697abb4f.avif?t=1744331296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zombie Wave Onslaught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zombie wave brings thousands sweeping in. Fend off uniquely threatening zombies, defeat powerful bosses, and adapt on the fly. Carve a path to survival through this endless tide of terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340120/extras/4279b2b216582e5ce62322f8fb441353.avif?t=1744331296\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
